# BUG-260801-1iu1ln cycle-10 developer evidence

## Provenance

- Worktree: `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/BUG-260801-1iu1ln/worktree`
- Branch: `task/BUG-260801-1iu1ln-lifecycle-observed-traces`
